{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52638","headline":"云中古城赋附歌 一 · 张嵩","name":"云中古城赋附歌 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魏家美人闻姓元，新声巧妙今古传。\n昔日流音遍华夏，可怜埋骨委山樊。\n城阙摧残犹可惜，荒郊处处生荆棘。\n寒飈动地胡马嘶，若个征夫不沾臆。\n人生荣耀当及时，白发须臾乱如丝。\n君不见魏都行乐处，只今空有野风吹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张嵩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}